      "Lay the two volume inserts and the opposing power insert into their side channels. Match each retaining flange to its recess and check that the stems slide.",
      "Lower the bare iPhone 6s screen-up into the rear shell. Align the camera with the rear opening and the Lightning port with the end cutout.",
      "Lower the front bezel over the screen. Align the four countersinks with the rear nuts and keep the button flanges in their channels.",
      "Start all four M3 \u00d7 12 mm countersunk screws from the front. Tighten evenly until the halves meet, then check that each button moves freely and the charging plug clears the end wall.",
